  <h2>Why we will not promise perfect tracking</h2>
  <p>
    Even with expensive call tracking, a big chunk of calls that Google sent you can never be pinned
    to one source. A homeowner bounces between your ad, your website and your profile before they
    ring. Arguing about which one gets the credit produces confident-looking reports that are wrong,
    and owners cutting the budget on the thing that was actually working.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you are running two phones and losing recordings, that is a software problem, not a marketing
    one. Modern job software and phone systems make those gaps obvious. We will help you set that up
    properly, then judge the marketing on what is on your calendar and in your bank account.
  </p>
